OL,3,AChildren aged 5, 8 and 11 killed in US
OL,4,Aschool shooting before suspect shot by
OL,5,Abystander
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 16-year-old has shot dead three
OL,8,Fchildren and a teacher at a primary
OL,9,Fschool in the US state of Oregon before
OL,10,Fhe was killed by a bystander, police
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe suspect, who has not been named,
OL,14,Fforced his way into Silver Rail
OL,15,FElementary School in the city of Bend
OL,16,Fon Thursday afternoon by shooting at
OL,17,Flocked doors, Bend Police Chief Mike
OL,18,FKrantz confirmed.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
