OL,3,AChildren aged 5, 8 and 11 killed in US
OL,4,Aschool shooting before suspect shot by
OL,5,Abystander
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe teenager was shot dead by a
OL,8,Fcommunity member who "pursued him into
OL,9,Fthe school and engaged him", Krantz
OL,10,Fsaid. Police arrived three minutes
OL,11,Flater.
OL,13,FThe three children killed were aged
OL,14,Ffive, eight and 11. A seven-year-old
OL,15,Fand a 54-year-old teacher were taken to
OL,16,Fa hospital in a critical condition. It
OL,17,Fis unclear if the attacker had any
OL,18,Flinks to the school.
